  control count_bytes, control bytes in a file with ESC, ESC and SI: 3 (expect 3)
  control count_bytes, non-ASCII bytes in a file with one two-byte character: 2 (expect 2)
  control count_bytes on a clean file: 0 (expect 0)
  control count_bytes on an unreadable file: error (expect error)
  control count_lines on a three-line file: 3 (expect 3)
  control count_lines on an unreadable file: error (expect error)
  control count_matches_i on mixed case: 2 (expect 2)
  control count_matches on the same file, case sensitive: 1 (expect 1)
  control count_matches_i on an unreadable file: error (expect error)
  control run_lines on a command printing three lines: 3 (expect 3)
  control run_lines on a command printing nothing: 0 (expect 0)
